  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fact-finding visit innovative water technologies Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this fact-finding visit to Colombia is to inspire Dutch companies active in the sector of innovative water technologies on how they can contribute to the combi-track program Cartagena ABC, developed by the Netherlands embassy in Colombia, in collaboration with the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) and other Dutch governmental agencies.Besides, key stakeholders in the Colombian water sector will participate in this trip to obtain more knowledge and awareness of relevant Dutch services and solutions.The long-term goal is to contribute to the combi-track Cartagena ABC and improve water quality, access to water, biodiversity and resilience to climate change in Cartagena and the surrounding area.</narrative>
  </description>
